error Bad msg str|type P|name str|stock int|reserved int=0<type O|sku str|qty int|state str<ps{|os{|out[|fn qty t!Bad|guard$re`^\d+$`.test t and(int t)>0|!Bad"invalid quantity<int t<fn product sku!Bad|(ps.get sku)??!Bad"unknown product $sku<fn order id verb st!Bad|o(os.get id)??!Bad"unknown order $id|guard o.state==st|!Bad"order $id cannot $verb from $o.state<o<fn run w a!Bad|match w|"add|sku,name,q a|guard not ps.has sku|!Bad"product exists $sku<ps[sku]=P{name stock:(qty q?|"ok add $sku<"receive|sku,q a|n qty q?|p product sku?|p.stock+=n|"ok receive $sku stock=$p.stock<"order|id,sku,q a|n qty q?|p product sku?|guard not os.has id|!Bad"order exists $id<av p.stock-p.reserved|guard av>=n|!Bad"insufficient stock for $sku (available $av)<p.reserved+=n|os[id]=O{sku qty:n state:"Reserved|"ok order $id<"ship|id a[0|o order id"ship""Reserved"?|p ps[o.sku|p.stock-=o.qty|p.reserved-=o.qty|o.state="Shipped|"ok ship $id<"return|id a[0|o order id"return""Shipped"?|ps[o.sku].stock+=o.qty|o.state="Returned|"ok return $id<"cancel|id a[0|o order id"cancel""Reserved"?|ps[o.sku].reserved-=o.qty|o.state="Cancelled|"ok cancel $id<"report|ls["inventory:|for sku ps.keys>>sort|p ps[sku|ls.push"  $sku $p.name stock=$p.stock reserved=$p.reserved available={p.stock-p.reserved}<ls.push"orders:|for id,o os|ls.push"  $id $o.sku $o.qty $o.state<ls>>join"\n<_|!Bad"unknown command $w<<<for ln(fs.read proc.args[0]).lines|[w ..a]ln.trim.split|if w==none|continue<r run w a|out.push(if r.ok r.value"error: $r.error.msg<print(out>>join"\n